            <lg xml:id="m-e990775c-a89a-4b10-b5b8-7c47779c2df5">
              <l xml:id="m-c1ccdc87-4f04-4344-9a40-252758d2e848" facs="#m-97a4abb0-31cc-4c9b-ab7e-2344c0604108" label="ambiguous">February 2.</l><l xml:id="m-3f942dfc-af0b-47ee-8139-04ef6ed06f47" facs="#m-b3772454-5b03-4c33-9d02-2aba4e7ff9a1" label="ambiguous">1365</l><l xml:id="m-9c9b41fb-5b2f-4a0c-8ffe-fee8250d69a8" facs="#m-a702cd6e-62cc-41df-bc35-fdccd1b3a8fc" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-b8c1ba08-8065-4582-8849-2b60afb9031e" facs="#m-136bce73-aa44-41d9-97da-94f7bd4cb404" label="lyrics-like">yxáudi, Dómine, preces nostras :! subsídium nobis tuae pietátis impén¬</l><l xml:id="m-cb3b078d-2b7f-4185-932d-a3e080277250" facs="#m-6e42b939-1435-43cc-bb63-85b6f0fd0ef5" label="lyrics-like">C et, ut digna sint múnera, quae de. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-4f391b99-173b-4917-8ff9-81a2c68bab8d" facs="#m-8822c61d-5bcd-425f-a3c8-a8d1501d9e13" label="lyrics-like">óculis tuae majestátis offérimus,</l><l xml:id="m-7457649c-1d94-4954-9e72-81fed4aa7319" facs="#m-f4d9babe-d621-4aa6-b182-5e70afb0fc00" label="text-like">Preface of the Nativity, p. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-754f22a7-4ecb-47bc-9a5f-5a5adcba1e14" facs="#m-4e7ae0d0-54b5-46e8-842b-a65e21793b89" label="ambiguous">comm.S</l><l xml:id="m-ccace0dd-a3dd-4910-bc38-ec960c55ddc9" facs="#m-22ab8c19-dbc3-4035-8445-a6514c7c598b" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-0d21a016-8c73-49b1-8b50-21a531f755c7" facs="#m-97b3d8f5-9543-4cab-9899-d19fdd01d5fc" label="lyrics-like">REspónsum“ accé pit Síme-n</l><l xml:id="m-38c0ae5d-df1b-4e51-9992-26f74f334808" facs="#m-9d61f2fc-72ef-4a33-b0b9-64ebbca780db" label="lyrics-like">a Spí-ri-tu</l><l xml:id="m-ca7d7ffd-3b4d-4d3f-84f2-18d822ad0e88" facs="#m-c271e0ba-3eec-4585-ada9-6e1b4dd07000" label="lyrics-like">ni-si vidéret Chrí¬</l><l xml:id="m-1252c877-650f-44b8-8643-52057abeb0fd" facs="#m-a94c0dcb-7409-45d8-96b4-8c6db9c47155" label="lyrics-like">Sáncto, non vi-sú-rum se mórtem,</l><l xml:id="m-ccc6a090-cc8f-4825-8fd8-d318f7f3dd42" facs="#m-5f3edce3-b73f-4324-89b8-bccb62ec004d" label="lyrics-like">stum Dómi-ni.</l><l xml:id="m-1238faaa-8691-4c80-8e68-4bd973215561" facs="#m-4e4e35eb-01c4-4456-82fe-7976b2ca490c" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-1368e58d-34a7-4dbd-8c3d-a78202717c61" facs="#m-22ff4f1e-122c-4589-935a-0a32bee83492" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus, Dómine Deus no- ta María semper Virgine, et prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-34b22ced-ee67-46c4-bcea-d8290993d907" facs="#m-89a6c914-6a28-4348-a6d3-b03bf09b1786" label="lyrics-like">Uster: ut sacrosáncta mystéria, sens nobis remédium esse fácias, et</l><l xml:id="m-83a3bf84-b374-46ea-8faa-26179ec072c0" facs="#m-68bd7f50-f920-42ec-909b-47404cd22ac1" label="lyrics-like">quae pro reparatiónis nostrae mu- futúrum. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9186107b-349d-4959-b554-6b65c8305517" facs="#m-4cbcc9a2-caf5-4e28-bd9d-05720a18e67e" label="lyrics-like">nimine contulisti, intercedénte beá¬</l><l xml:id="m-a864128d-4a22-4dda-9c3a-de84510d0960" facs="#m-6a7d82e7-8a8f-4e1f-a64a-4cff61399b6c" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-c43c81b0-dd3f-4a84-9d2a-09a06dae77d5" facs="#m-165d36cd-2149-408e-ac3f-e03f354216f1" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Accípiens Simeon. p. 1366.</l><l xml:id="m-6396b05a-cb7c-470e-8537-36c194755ba4" facs="#m-ab9df07c-aed1-495a-908a-b4613070a4e6" label="ambiguous">Mal.3</l><l xml:id="m-c0417515-e57d-4176-a952-78154c1fe2e4" facs="#m-6f29f874-3389-4895-ba0e-a710463ed7d4" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-14d65831-8132-4199-a77f-5f36c4d87d80" facs="#m-8ae97fba-c005-4d6d-b31e-59550e74d8bd" label="lyrics-like">"Cce véniet, dicit Dóminus exer-! stabit ad vidéndum eum? Ipse enim</l><l xml:id="m-5b0ba41e-ed8e-42f7-9034-a5709e79b794" facs="#m-685cc911-41b9-4c03-acaa-de80e3a646e1" label="lyrics-like">U cituum: t et quis póterit cogi-l quasi ignis conflans, * et quasi</l><l xml:id="m-67f5d469-7c80-4b4f-92f1-e158d69477d2" facs="#m-33182a43-e10b-4820-94fe-6bd4565477c5" label="lyrics-like">táre diem advéntus ejus, et quis l herba fullónum.</l><l xml:id="m-0b3c9909-e464-4b6a-866e-078bc70da062" facs="#m-0923be18-3bfa-4f88-9b3b-86ffce867156" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Adjuvábit eam. p. 1257. V. Elégit eam.</l><l xml:id="m-cd6ebb7a-f5ce-44a2-97b2-471b3be848e1" facs="#m-a8cde1af-e276-45ab-9820-9253ff8d7b64" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-44addaaa-a4ed-4699-a2f1-1695aee6a1b0" facs="#m-cd934cdc-eaa7-42c9-aa95-8d978ad345ff" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Obtulérunt. p. 1366.</l><l xml:id="m-4dd7ac45-c3dd-44f1-bb5a-a445070f1db0" facs="#m-fa7ee3e6-c6a6-408b-bb7c-b10baf20db7d" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-55f25fea-613e-4e7b-853d-5568f3c9d45b" facs="#m-0aea90e0-da45-4502-ad94-6bfdbb2f6dd1" label="ambiguous">Mal.3.</l><l xml:id="m-8f194231-dcf2-4063-8432-a8c53be72444" facs="#m-40327b12-abb2-43be-bc31-1d23ad776d47" label="lyrics-like">T placébit Dómino sacrificium! saéculi, t et sicut anni antíqui,</l><l xml:id="m-749509d3-fcdb-4ae1-a2cd-099b76b13a31" facs="#m-e6513598-d1f3-4ea3-9a68-344dba2444b8" label="lyrics-like">LJuda et Jerúsalem sicut dies! dicit Dóminus omnipotens.</l><l xml:id="m-4438a5e6-635b-4dad-97f2-356d1c679016" facs="#m-46fc7d3d-96d6-4b82-8f6d-12c1ed1d1d85" label="lyrics-like">Short Reso. Elégit eam. D. 1 V. Diffúsa est.</l><l xml:id="m-219a4367-1837-4e3f-80fd-cfafb88727d7" facs="#m-02d8e624-f25f-4b13-9319-18546bdf919a" label="ambiguous">N° 801. — 30</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
